<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Electric - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Electric - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.26 trln	 vs	    1.16 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   73.21		vs	   54.95</p>
<p> Current	     65.96		vs	   51.24</p>
<p> Net		   32.21		vs	   28.07</p>
<p> EPS		   45.22 yen	  vs	   39.49 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 41.93 yen	  vs	   37.87 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Electric Industries Ltd is a major electric wire and cable maker.</p>
